# Adult schedule: same-month unique hard + prefer previous month

- EN: same `clickUrl` at most **once** per calendar month (hard). No same-month reuse.
- JP: same `dmmUrl` at most **once** per calendar month (hard). No same-month reuse.
- Cross-month OK: prefer affiliates that appeared in the previous month's pack (`fromPrevMonth`).
- Why no same-month reuse: X native schedule may reject / look spammy with duplicate affiliate URLs in one month.
- Zero-gap aim: expand inventory first (EN Carib deep links / JP search queries), then fill. If still short → WARN + leave gap (pack still written). `--strict` hard-fails.
- JP dig list: `input/adult-jp-search-queries.json` (search keywords, not new weekday genres).
- EN catalog mix: Caribbeancom main; Caribbeancom Premium deep-links to grow; 10musume / muramura / pacopacomama = one each per month.
- EN landing: **Direct (`moviepages`) first**. Site entrance (`eng/index2.htm` etc.) is not scheduled — entrance portraits are SFW face assets only.
- Generator: `scripts/generate-adult-month-packs.py`.
- Month-end auto (EN+JP): launchd `com.miyasakaharuki.adult-month-prep` → 毎月27–29日 10:00 → `run-adult-month-prep.sh` → `prep-adult-next-month.sh`（30–31でX予約想定）.
- Install: `scripts/install-adult-month-prep-agent.sh`. Log: `output/adult-month-prep.log`.
- Hand-load: EN copy.html first, then JP. X schedule is Mac web only. Mac must not sleep through the window.
